values ('hormone-test-kit-home-5', 'HH-HR-001', 'care-health', '{"ar":"اختبار هرمونات منزلي — بانل 5","en":"Hormone Test Kit — Home 5-Panel","tl":"Hormone Test Kit — Home 5-Panel"}', '{"ar":"اختبار منزلي وأنت في منزلك بخمس قياسات، مع تفسير مختبري عبر شريك معتمد. يُستخدم للاختبار الشخصي ولا يُغني عن استشارة طبية.","en":"A home collection kit with five measurements and lab-based interpretation through a certified partner. For personal testing only — it does not replace medical advice.","tl":"Home collection kit na may limang sukat at lab-based interpretasyon sa certified partner. Para sa personal na pagsubok lang — hindi kapalit ng medikal na payo."}', '{"ar":"منتج منظّم مقيد بالعمر +18. لا يتضمن أي دواء. النتائج توضيحية وتتطلب متابعة مهنية عند وجود مؤشرات غير طبيعية.","en":"A regulated, age-restricted (18+) product. Contains no medicine. Results are informational — follow up with a professional if markers look unusual.","tl":"Regulado, 18+ na produkto. Walang gamot sa loob. Ang resulta ay pawang impormasyon — magpakonsulti ka pa rin sa propesyunal."}', null, null, 'CheckUp@Home', 'Medistream Diagnostics', 'Netherlands', 399.00, null, 11, array['data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%22720%22%20height%3D%22612%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20720%20612%22%3E%0A%20%20%3Cdefs%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22bg%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%22720%22%20y2%3D%22612%22%20gradientUnits%3D%22userSpaceOnUse%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23fdeef1%22%2F%3E%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23f3cdd9%22%2F%3E%3C%2FlinearGradient%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%3ClinearGradient%20id%3D%22body%22%20x1%3D%220%22%20y1%3D%220%22%20x2%3D%221%22%20y2%3D%221%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%220%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20stop-opacity%3D%220.97%22%2F%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cstop%20offset%3D%221%22%20stop-color%3D%22%23ffffff%22%20stop-opacity%3D%220.8%22%2